    "created_at": "2023-07-23T18:15:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T18:15:16Z",
    "body": "I've seen someone else report a similar issue on an M1 mac before, but I've not encountered it since the \"fix\" in macOS 13 on my intel -based iMac. With macOS 13 and newer mac hardware it seems Apple has also introduced something called [Adaptive sync](https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT212232) that is supposed to adapt the monitor refresh rate to content refresh. It's not supported on my mac so I can't test it, but perhaps that could be related to this if it's enabled?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
