    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T21:15:33Z",
    "body": "I think it is unlikely that this has to do with Adaptive Sync, since it is happening on the built-in display of my MacBook Air. Without an Adaptive Sync monitor, I also cannot test this, and there is no mention of this in my laptop's display settings. As best I can tell, the built-in display has a constant 60 Hz refresh rate.",
