    "created_at": "2023-07-23T21:28:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-23T21:30:03Z",
    "body": "> As best I can tell, the built-in display has a constant 60 Hz refresh rate.\r\n\r\nAll MacBook Air models have a fixed 60 Hz refresh rate, so this is correct. Dynamic refresh rate is only present on built-in 120 Hz displays, and it's disabled if you force 60 Hz as I understand it.",
