    "created_at": "2026-03-21T05:16:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-21T05:16:45Z",
    "body": "Can confirm that the issue still persists.\n\nMacBook Air 15-inch, M2, 2023, macOS Tahoe Version 26.2\nGodot v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\nWhen running a scene:\n- embedded in editor with either Compatibility or Forward+ renderer, VSync works as expected, 60fps\n- not embedded from editor with Forward+ renderer, VSync works as expected, 60 fps\n- not embedded from editor with Compatibility rendered, VSync results in 120 fps, double of the display 60 Hz refresh rate",
